<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on three UK stocks.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on three UK stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 10 million American-style call warrants each on shares of Marks and Spencers Plc, Rolls-Royce Plc and Grand Metropolitan Plc.</p>
<p>One warrant refers to one underlying.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   07.AUG.98		 PAYDATE	14.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	 STRIKE     ISSUE	  PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> M&amp;S	     4.87 STG   0.5938 STG   12.19 PCT   8.2 TIMES</p>
<p> ROLLS ROYCE   2.41 STG   0.45 STG     18.67 PCT   6.8 TIMES</p>
<p> GRAND MET     4.54 STG   0.5886 STG   12.9 PCT    7.82 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
